    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えー……『ラジオネーム、眼福さん\r\n樹里ちゃんの一番の魅力は笑顔』",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えっ！？　マジかよ……\r\n……あ、ありがとうございます……！　次……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "『ラジオネーム、ラムネさん\r\n運動神経が良くてダンスが上手いところ』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー、これはマジで嬉しいな……！\r\nオーディションに向けてもダンス頑張ってるからな！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "続いて『ラジオネーム、定時後最終電車さん\r\n放クラの常識人、貴重なツッコミなところ』",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はは、これメンバーにも聞かせたいな\r\nつーか、そういうのもちゃんと見てくれてるんだな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それから『ラジオネーム、バッドボーイさん\r\n一見ヤンキーだけど、優しくて思いやりがあるギャップ』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "や、ヤンキーじゃないっつの！\r\nつーか別に優しくも、ねーし……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "………………はい\r\nありがとうございます、もっと頑張らねーとな……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "すげーいっぱい送ってもらった中からスタッフさんに\r\n選んでもらったのを紹介させてもらいました……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──うん、でもなんつーか\r\nみんなのお陰で、宿題のヒントを出してもらった感じがする",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003030160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "貰ったメッセージは全部ちゃんと読んでるからさ！\r\n全部紹介出来なくてごめん、本当にありがとな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100303/1011003030160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
